1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,508
Claude 动手写代码之前，
Before Claude writes a line of code,

2
00:00:01,528 --> 00:00:03,610
最该做的，是不让它动手。
the best thing you can do is stop it from writing any.

3
00:00:03,630 --> 00:00:06,717
官方入门课教的标准工作流，就四步：
The standard workflow in Anthropic's intro course

4
00:00:06,737 --> 00:00:09,311
探索、计划、编码、提交。
has four steps: explore, plan, code, commit.

5
00:00:09,331 --> 00:00:10,964
前两步放在计划模式里：
The first two happen in plan mode:

6
00:00:10,984 --> 00:00:12,617
它先把相关文件读一遍，
it reads the relevant files,

7
00:00:12,637 --> 00:00:15,271
研究、出方案，但不改你的源码。
researches and proposes, but doesn't edit your source.

8
00:00:15,291 --> 00:00:16,515
计划出来先看一遍，
Read the plan before anything runs,

9
00:00:16,535 --> 00:00:18,631
不满意就告诉它具体改哪一块。
and tell it exactly which part to change.

10
00:00:18,651 --> 00:00:19,900
这时候纠偏最划算，
This is the cheapest moment to correct course,

11
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:21,491
因为一行代码还没写。
because no code exists yet.

12
00:00:21,511 --> 00:00:24,851
按 Ctrl+G，能直接在编辑器里改计划。
Press Ctrl+G to edit the plan right in your editor.

13
00:00:24,871 --> 00:00:26,710
编码阶段给它三样东西：
In the coding phase, give it three things:

14
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:28,569
成功标准、趁手的工具、
a success criterion, the right tools,

15
00:00:28,589 --> 00:00:30,321
能反复跑的测试。
and tests it can run repeatedly.

16
00:00:30,341 --> 00:00:32,010
装上 Claude in Chrome，
Install the Claude in Chrome extension and it can open pages

17
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:34,801
它能自己测界面，需直连官方账号。
and test your interface itself, on a direct Anthropic plan.

18
00:00:34,821 --> 00:00:37,176
官方课还提醒：测试要靠得住，
The course also warns: the tests have to be trustworthy,

19
00:00:37,196 --> 00:00:39,781
别让它削弱测试来蒙混过关。
and Claude shouldn't weaken them just to pass.

20
00:00:39,801 --> 00:00:41,951
提交之前，先让子代理审一遍：
Before committing, have a subagent review the work:

21
00:00:41,971 --> 00:00:44,301
它没参与写代码，眼光是新的。
it didn't write the code, so it brings fresh eyes.

22
00:00:44,321 --> 00:00:45,659
官方课还列了提交前
The course also lists three things

23
00:00:45,679 --> 00:00:47,470
看的三样：没要求的改动、
to check before committing: changes you didn't ask for,

24
00:00:47,490 --> 00:00:49,461
变弱的测试、硬编码的值。
weakened tests, and hard-coded values.

25
00:00:49,481 --> 00:00:51,366
提交信息想要固定格式？
Want a fixed commit message format?

26
00:00:51,386 --> 00:00:54,571
把约定写进 CLAUDE.md，它就照做。
Put the convention in CLAUDE.md.

27
00:00:54,591 --> 00:00:57,058
官方也说：一句话说得清的小改动，
Anthropic also says: if you can describe the diff in one

28
00:00:57,078 --> 00:00:58,481
别计划，直接做。
sentence, skip the plan.

29
00:00:58,501 --> 00:01:00,781
先看后改，先审后交。
Look before you change; review before you ship.
